{"3075410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hand of Fate: Hordes", "steam_appid": 3075410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4953230], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/ab491d5c27ac71e80c3f5ea2fa13751f.avif?t=1787865755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/ab491d5c27ac71e80c3f5ea2fa13751f.avif?t=1787865755 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAND OF FATE: HORDES is a new fantasy adventure beyond the 13th Gate. Control powerful heroes and carve your way through dungeons, quests, and endless monsters and bosses. Grow your powers every run with new weapons and enchantments. Choose your cards wisely and thrive in chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/e7459147c60b99af88f452498df58644.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/ecdff8a55c5bfa7810fc336c4503575f.avif?t=1787865755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/ecdff8a55c5bfa7810fc336c4503575f.webp?t=1787865755 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the world of Hand of Fate imprisoned within the Shadow Vaults where the banished Dealer devises your demise. Unravel his dark designs as you carve through endless hordes, deadly quests, and fearsome bosses to break free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master four heroes – Trickster, Goblin, Warrior, and Rebel –  each with distinct ranged, melee, and magic fighting styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn. Adapt. Conquer. Master every dungeon's layouts, secrets, and special features to make smarter choices and push further with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your powers with new cards, abilities and rewards and twist the dungeons to your advantage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the original indie designers of Hand of Fate™. Starring Hand of Fate's Anthony Skordi as the Dealer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/d3f5a77197913dc15bacc8a2af1ef02f.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/29f949e2387288cf3c2e24ba552b58de.avif?t=1787865755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/29f949e2387288cf3c2e24ba552b58de.webp?t=1787865755 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of enemies as your powers grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills for each hero. Every card. Every encounter. Every decision could bring you closer to freedom—or deeper into The Dealer’s trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your powers with every run. Unlock new rarities, story Encounters, fantasy melee, ranged, and magic weapons, treasure-filled events, and powerful blessing modifiers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/ae3ef9edf00eabab19259d8c6e498c62.avif?t=1787865755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras_big/ae3ef9edf00eabab19259d8c6e498c62.webp?t=1787865755 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win powerful boons and buffs through card shuffle and dice minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Tokens that unlock game changing rewards at the end of each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Heroes, Quests, Dungeons, Bosses, and Weapon updates dropped throughout the year. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.poster.avif?t=1787865755\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.webm?t=1787865755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075410/extras/f589e2d38392c18e8d454de8467387c5.mp4?t=1787865755\" type=\"v